
Installing ARGOCD SERVER
# THIS IS TO CREATE OR DEPLOY ARGOCD IN A KUBERNETES CLUSTER

1) Ensure you can access the Cluster

2) kubectl create namespace argocd
  2.1 kubectl get namespace

3) kubectl apply -n argocd --server-side --force-conflicts -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/argoproj/argo-cd/stable/manifests/install.yaml
   3.1. kubectl get pod -n argocd
   3.2. kubectl get svc -n argocd
   3.3. kubectl get secret -n argocd
   3.4 change the argocd-service from clusterip to nodeport using this command
       kubectl patch svc argocd-server -n argocd  -p '{"spec":{"type":"NodePort"}}'

4) kubectl -n argocd get secret argocd-initial-admin-secret -o jsonpath="{.data.password}" | base64 -d; echo




